### ✅ `Main.java` (to test all)

```java
import package1.*;
import package2.*;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        BaseClass base = new BaseClass();
        base.display();

        new SamePackageSubclass().display();
        new SamePackageNonSubclass().display();
        new DifferentPackageSubclass().display();
        new DifferentPackageNonSubclass().display();
    }
}
```

